      "desc": "A commemorative namecard for the New Eridu City Fund: Premium Plan.",
      "desc2": "I arrived at the best snorkeling spot in New Eridu, recommended by the heir of a certain prominent family! But I politely turned down the photographer she suggested.\nMaybe... when faced with a vibrant, unfamiliar world, there's no better photographer than curiosity; and when it comes to those we spend every day with, no technique beats patience and love.\n—That doesn't guarantee a beautiful result, though.",
